     "html": "<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Rule</th><th>Trigger</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>G-R1</td><td>Transaction declined, condition: the transaction is a deposit</td><td>Add client tag <code>deposit-failed</code></td></tr><tr><td>G-R2</td><td>Transaction declined, same condition</td><td>Run Scheduler → scheduled rule after 3 days: Remove client tag <code>deposit-failed</code></td></tr><tr><td>G-R3</td><td>Deposit approved</td><td>Remove client tag <code>deposit-failed</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
