   "bodyHtml": "<p>Hi {{first_name}},</p>\n<p>Your deposit has arrived. Three habits that help a balance last:</p>\n<ul><li>keep each position small relative to what's in the account</li><li>set a stop-loss on every trade</li><li>decide a daily loss limit, and stop when you reach it</li></ul>"
