   "bodyHtml": "<p>Hi {{first_name}},</p>\n<p>With a Cent account your balance is counted in US cents, so a $10 deposit shows as 1,000 cents and each position is 100 times smaller than on a standard account.</p>\n<p>It makes each trade smaller. It does not remove the risk of loss.</p>"
