   "bodyHtml": "<p>Hi {{first_name}},</p>\n<p>Thank you for joining today's session. The recording is ready, with chapters so you can jump to the part you need, and the questions and answers from the chat underneath.</p>\n<p>If anything is still unclear, reply to this email and we'll help.</p>"
